    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Purpose</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"excerpt\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"638aebc5-f96c-44fe-9484-b0037d832b70\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"atlassian-macro-output-type\">INLINE</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>The drugogram or the chronic treatment chart is a display that shows the current drug regimen of a patient enrolled into a treatment which involves a varying set of drugs over the course of the treatment.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"ce5c5eb4-04fa-4794-8cd2-1e9dfcc67137\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Please read more about <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=94535717\">Chronic Treatment Chart </a></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2>Screenshot</h2><p><br /><ac:image ac:width=\"600\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2016-06-28 at 10.31.02 AM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><h2>Configuration</h2><h3>Sample Config</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c8d0fc91-89a6-42f3-b551-202d8626d630\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Add to clinical/dashboard.json for it to appear on the patient dashboard</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"linenumbers\">true</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[\"Chronic Treatment Chart\": {\n\t\"displayType\": \"Full-Page\",\n\t\"title\": \"Chronic Treatment Chart\",\n    \"type\": \"chronicTreatmentChart\",\n    \"dashboardConfig\": {\n    \t\"drugs\": []\n     },\n     \"expandedViewConfig\": {\n     \t\"drugs\": []\n     }\n}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h3>Key Field Table</h3><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th>Key</th><th>Value</th><th>Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td><p>type</p></td><td><p>type of the section or control.</p><p><strong>type should be &quot;<span>chronicTreatmentChart</span>&quot;</strong></p></td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><p>drugs</p></td><td>drugs concept name which you want to show. (If you don't specify drugs in the config, it shows all the drugs which the patient is currently on)</td><td>No</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9e21e6bc-65b4-4f30-a341-0dc091c2e859\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c600f8c4-b8b4-4eb8-bd41-e903ed368a03\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"11c594ed-5883-4869-a352-0f4f6562d86e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">White</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Display Controls</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"de12be85-d772-4bad-93f7-a404f07e5146\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"all\">true</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"page\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Medication Controls\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:link></ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
