      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ChronicTreatmentChartControl-Purpose\">Purpose</h2><p>The drugogram or the chronic treatment chart is a display that shows the current drug regimen of a patient enrolled into a treatment which involves a varying set of drugs over the course of the treatment.</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ce5c5eb4-04fa-4794-8cd2-1e9dfcc67137\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Please read more about <a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=94535717\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chronic Treatment Chart </a></p></div></div><h2 id=\"ChronicTreatmentChartControl-Screenshot\">Screenshot</h2><p><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114207300/Screen%20Shot%202016-06-28%20at%2010.31.02%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484670817011&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=138\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114207300/Screen%20Shot%202016-06-28%20at%2010.31.02%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484670817011&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114207223\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-06-28 at 10.31.02 AM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114207300\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"12\" data-media-id=\"fb220384-e1ce-4be1-aa52-073e0e78ac0d\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114207300/Screen%20Shot%202016-06-28%20at%2010.31.02%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484670817011&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=276 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114207300/Screen%20Shot%202016-06-28%20at%2010.31.02%20AM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484670817011&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=138 1x\"></span></p><h2 id=\"ChronicTreatmentChartControl-Configuration\">Configuration</h2><h3 id=\"ChronicTreatmentChartControl-SampleConfig\">Sample Config</h3><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c8d0fc91-89a6-42f3-b551-202d8626d630\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Add to clinical/dashboard.json for it to appear on the patient dashboard</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;Chronic Treatment Chart&quot;: {\n\t&quot;displayType&quot;: &quot;Full-Page&quot;,\n\t&quot;title&quot;: &quot;Chronic Treatment Chart&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;chronicTreatmentChart&quot;,\n    &quot;dashboardConfig&quot;: {\n    \t&quot;drugs&quot;: []\n     },\n     &quot;expandedViewConfig&quot;: {\n     \t&quot;drugs&quot;: []\n     }\n}</pre>\n</div></div><h3 id=\"ChronicTreatmentChartControl-KeyFieldTable\">Key Field Table</h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Key</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Value</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>type</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>type of the section or control.</p><p><strong>type should be &quot;<span>chronicTreatmentChart</span>&quot;</strong></p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Yes</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>drugs</p></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">drugs concept name which you want to show. (If you don't specify drugs in the config, it shows all the drugs which the patient is currently on)</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">No</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9e21e6bc-65b4-4f30-a341-0dc091c2e859\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"c600f8c4-b8b4-4eb8-bd41-e903ed368a03\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"11c594ed-5883-4869-a352-0f4f6562d86e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: White;\"><b>Related Display Controls</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"de12be85-d772-4bad-93f7-a404f07e5146\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114207300/Chronic+Treatment+Chart+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114207300\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Chronic Treatment Chart Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/98402409/Drug+Order+Treatment+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"98402409\" data-linked-resource-version=\"13\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Drug Order / Treatment Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/99123216/Treatment+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"99123216\" data-linked-resource-version=\"20\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Treatment Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114746475/Treatment+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114746475\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Treatment Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3152838666/Sending+prescription+to+patients\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3152838666\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Sending prescription to patients</a></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
